# What the dependences of this file have to come out as.
#
# The member's accesses survive under the representative's name, and the
# flow between the loop that writes and the loop that reads survives with
# them.  Without the array the annotation names, reads comes back empty,
# may_writes keeps only the store to o, and dep_flow is empty.
#
# Brackets are balanced on purpose: file(STRINGS) keeps reading past the
# newline when a line leaves one open, and three expectations then arrive
# as one that matches nothing.
reads *: \{ S_1\[[a-z_0-9]+\] -> rep\[o0\]
may_writes *: \{ S_0\[[a-z_0-9]+\] -> rep\[o0\]
dep_flow *: \{ S_0\[[a-z_0-9]+\] -> S_1\[[a-z_0-9]+\]
